            "tender": {
                "id": "Con_18643",
                "title": "Net zero reporting programme",
                "description": "A contract to provide consultancy services to fulfil the following requirements. Data and technology landscape research and developmentDeliverable - DfE Sustainability and Climate Change Data and technology research report.Must Include.A report on research into the existing data on education sector building stock .An analysis of current DfE approach and existing climate change-related data collection and reporting.A description of optimal 'to-be' future data and technology architecture that drives value for money and reduces reporting burdens across the education estate.Technology evaluation frameworkDeliverable - Technology evaluation frameworkMust include.Research of technology options and engagement with vendors to support the DfE net zero strategy,Testing different methods of collecting new data and combining sustainability related technologies.Assess potential technology options.Design of the programme evaluation approachUser definition and requirements researchDeliverable - User definition and requirements research backlogMust include.Collect stakeholder requirements.Collation of research based on interviews.Report of identified requirements to deliver on the DfE's sustainability strategy.Future research and development definitionDeliverable - Programme definition and roadmapMust include.Define future programme vision, scope and high-level resource requirements.Definition of potential future research.Define 'value case' for each initiative considering benefits, costs and assumptions.",
